SUMMARY:Drink & Draw: Birds
DTSTAMP:20260806T110914Z
DTSTART:20260829T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:$22 member / $37 nonmemberAges 21+ \n\n\n\nYes\, you CAN draw –
	 and have fun while you do it! Grab a beer or nonalcoholic beverage from S
